1
00:00:03,020 --> 00:00:06,740
阿憨居然要我们打扫这间破餐厅
I can't believe Han is making us tidy up this damn diner.

2
00:00:07,100 --> 00:00:09,640
这跟让妓女戴端庄的教堂帽一样
It's like putting a pretty church hat on a whore.

3
00:00:12,600 --> 00:00:14,640
拜托 使劲 快点
Come on, harder, faster!

4
00:00:14,800 --> 00:00:15,940
做再快点 再使劲点
Do it faster and harder.

5
00:00:16,760 --> 00:00:19,600
这是阿憨对妓男爱力克湿的语录集吗
What is, "things Han says to a male hustler," Alex.

6
00:00:21,220 --> 00:00:22,580
没时间开玩笑了 麦克斯
No time for jokes, Max.

7
00:00:22,620 --> 00:00:24,280
卫生检查员很快就要到了
The health inspector will be here soon,

8
00:00:24,280 --> 00:00:25,800
我一定要得到A级
and I need to get that "A" rating.

9
00:00:26,220 --> 00:00:28,420
这件餐厅想拿到A级干净度评鉴
This diner getting an "A" for cleanliness

10
00:00:28,420 --> 00:00:30,820
就跟我去买A罩杯胸罩一样不可能
would be like me getting an "A" for a bra size.

11
00:00:32,320 --> 00:00:35,280
肯定能 我做得很彻底
Oh, it will happen. I did a thorough job.

12
00:00:42,620 --> 00:00:45,260
他是料理铁人还是绝命毒师啊
Is he making omelets or crystal meth?

13
00:00:47,940 --> 00:00:49,760
奥列格 你让阿憨给你戴上两个发网啊
Oleg, you let Han put you in two hair nets?

14
00:00:50,360 --> 00:00:52,800
三个 还有一个我不想说在哪
Three. I don't want to talk about it.

15
00:01:09,060 --> 00:01:11,020
抱歉迟到了 我刚做指甲耽搁了
Sorry I'm late. I was having my nails done.

16
00:01:11,340 --> 00:01:13,320
这是两年来我第一次不用马不停蹄忙活
It's the first time I stopped moving in two years,

17
00:01:13,320 --> 00:01:14,460
我居然睡着了
and I fell asleep.

18
00:01:16,080 --> 00:01:18,080
你居然有钱去做指甲
You had money to get your nails done?

19
00:01:18,280 --> 00:01:21,180
提问 做妓有你想象中那么糟吗
Question: Was prostitution as disgusting as you thought it would be?

20
00:01:23,140 --> 00:01:24,520
阿憨出钱的啦
Han paid for it.

21
00:01:24,660 --> 00:01:25,820
那就是比你想象中还惨
Oh, so it was worse.

22
00:01:28,120 --> 00:01:29,300
你来啦
There she is.

23
00:01:29,660 --> 00:01:31,080
我的镇店美人
There's my show pony.

24
00:01:32,740 --> 00:01:34,140
让我看看你那玉手
Let me see them digits.

25
00:01:34,660 --> 00:01:36,480
我要你当检查员进店后
I want you to be the first thing

26
00:01:36,480 --> 00:01:37,960
第一眼见到的人事物
the health inspector sees when he enters.

27
00:01:38,140 --> 00:01:39,760
你金发闪闪 整洁大方
You're just so blonde and clean.

28
00:01:43,680 --> 00:01:46,100
那我呢 为何我啥好处都没有
Where's my manicure? How come I don't get anything?

29
00:01:46,380 --> 00:01:48,700
哪可能忘了你的份 50块给你
Oh, I haven't forgotten you. Here's 50 bucks.

30
00:01:48,700 --> 00:01:50,972
他来检查时 你待一边去
Beat it until the inspector leaves.

31
00:01:53,160 --> 00:01:56,300
有人会觉得这是侮辱 但我只要求给75块
Some would be insulted. I'm gonna ask for $75.

32
00:01:57,280 --> 00:01:58,920
妥了 给你吧
And, you are going to get it.

33
00:02:03,320 --> 00:02:05,700
我有个好消息 在做指甲时
I have exciting news. At the nail salon,

34
00:02:05,700 --> 00:02:08,100
我听说了一个很值得我们去的研讨会
I heard about this amazing seminar we should go to.

35
00:02:08,240 --> 00:02:10,000
不要 不行 不许
Oh, no, no, no.

36
00:02:10,380 --> 00:02:12,240
我去过一个研讨会
I went to a seminar once.

37
00:02:12,440 --> 00:02:14,300
那次差点被三百个韩国人强娶
I was almost married to 300 Koreans.

38
00:02:15,740 --> 00:02:18,320
这是给企业主参加的品牌研讨会
It's a branding seminar for business owners

39
00:02:18,320 --> 00:02:20,620
讲如何搞清自己品牌的定位 并做好准备
to define who they are and get them primed and ready

40
00:02:20,620 --> 00:02:22,220
等待机遇之窗的到来
for their window of opportunity.

41
00:02:22,600 --> 00:02:24,740
我还宁愿我被三百韩国人强娶呢
I think I'd rather be married to 300 Koreans.

42
00:02:25,780 --> 00:02:27,560
这样我就能随时做指甲了
Then I could get my nails done whenever I wanted.

43
00:02:28,920 --> 00:02:29,960
麦克斯 这不是骗人的
Max, this is the real deal.

44
00:02:29,960 --> 00:02:32,150
开研讨会的女人是品牌大师呢
The woman who runs it is a branding genius.

45
00:02:32,700 --> 00:02:34,380
耐克的"做就对了"标语就是她的作品
She created the Nike "Just do it."

46
00:02:34,700 --> 00:02:36,720
"做"就对了才不是她发明的呢
Oh, that woman didn't make up "Just do it."

47
00:02:36,800 --> 00:02:39,020
这话被高中泡妞淫男们用了几百年了
High school boyfriends have been using that for centuries.

48
00:02:40,860 --> 00:02:42,000
你怎么还没走
You're still here!

49
00:02:42,040 --> 00:02:43,600
要给多少你才满意啊 再加10块如何
What's it gonna take, another $10?

50
00:02:45,480 --> 00:02:46,980
我根本不需要参加研讨会
Hey, I don't need a seminar.

51
00:02:47,100 --> 00:02:49,400
我发现我能致富的品牌了 "讨人厌"
I found a brand that's gonna get me rich: obnoxious!

52
00:02:51,460 --> 00:02:53,880
厄尔 清理你收银台的进度如何了
Okay, Earl, how is cleaning your area coming along?

53
00:02:54,180 --> 00:02:56,760
我发现不少陈年老纸巾
I've got decades of napkins over here

54
00:02:56,760 --> 00:02:58,880
上面写满了我当年的奇思妙想
with all my old ideas on them.

55
00:02:58,880 --> 00:03:01,000
看来纸巾就是当年的微博啊
Apparently, napkins were the old Twitter.

56
00:03:04,860 --> 00:03:05,340
你好
Hello.

57
00:03:05,760 --> 00:03:06,760
能告知店主
Could you tell the owner

58
00:03:06,760 --> 00:03:08,260
卫生检查员到了吗
the health inspector has arrived?

59
00:03:08,600 --> 00:03:10,340
原来您是女人
Oh, you are a woman.

60
00:03:10,740 --> 00:03:11,840
真谢谢你看出来啊
Thank you for noticing.

61
00:03:14,220 --> 00:03:15,760
你就是李憨吗
Are you Han Lee?

62
00:03:16,160 --> 00:03:17,460
阿憨 这是...
Hey, Han, is this the...

63
00:03:20,960 --> 00:03:22,680
那请问您想先从哪开始检查呢
So where would you like to start?

64
00:03:22,960 --> 00:03:24,960
先从"男厕"开始吧
Sadly, the men's room.

65
00:03:25,540 --> 00:03:26,640
核弹爆点级灾区
Ground zero.

66
00:03:27,840 --> 00:03:29,460
我很快就来陪您
I will join you in a second.

67
00:03:29,700 --> 00:03:31,280
先请问是萝特洛小姐还是太太
Is it Miss or Mrs. Rotello?

68
00:03:32,460 --> 00:03:34,900
是小姐 谢谢你询问
It's Miss. Thank you for asking.

69
00:03:35,740 --> 00:03:37,260
咱们厕所里见
I'll see you at the toilets.

70
00:03:39,140 --> 00:03:41,300
重灾区现在感觉美好多了
Ground zero just got a lot nicer.

71
00:03:44,800 --> 00:03:48,840
阿憨 检察员小姐好像是想"检查"你哦
Han, I think that health inspector wants to inspect you.

72
00:03:50,520 --> 00:03:52,820
别乱说 她听见了 会给我个"F"的
Stop! If she hears you, she'll give me an "F."

73
00:03:53,100 --> 00:03:55,200
她应该是想你"F"[操]她吧
I think she wants you to give her an "F."

74
00:03:57,000 --> 00:03:59,360
麦克斯 我付你90块了 快走人
Max, I paid you $90. Now, go!

75
00:04:01,440 --> 00:04:02,980
-给 麦克斯 -这是什么
- Here, Max. - What's this?

76
00:04:03,100 --> 00:04:05,180
我们参加研讨会的六百块就靠这个赚了
That's how we'll make the $600 we need for the seminar.

77
00:04:05,340 --> 00:04:07,380
我去金考打印店印了旧货拍卖传单
I made flyers for a yard sale at Kinko's.

78
00:04:07,840 --> 00:04:10,840
哇 同一句话里说出"金考"跟"旧货拍卖"
Wow, "Kinko's" and "yard sale" in the same breath.

79
00:04:11,280 --> 00:04:13,660
我内心是怎么强大到这地步的
Where do I keep finding this inner strength?

80
00:04:17,820 --> 00:04:20,160
估计是苏菲带着要卖的旧货来了
That must be Sophie with her yard sale stuff.

81
00:04:21,540 --> 00:04:22,440
姑娘们 你们好啊
Hi, girls!

82
00:04:24,280 --> 00:04:26,080
苏菲 你的那些垃圾旧物[阴茎]呢
Hey, Sophie! Where's all your junk?

83
00:04:26,080 --> 00:04:29,180
跟平常一样 放我后车厢里了[屁股]
Oh, where it always is, in my trunk!

84
00:04:31,028 --> 00:04:33,820
你看这里
Well, look here.

85
00:04:33,820 --> 00:04:35,640
这里面放了不少奥列格
I got a bunch of stuff that Oleg wanted

86
00:04:35,640 --> 00:04:37,440
想捐给你们拍卖的东西
to donate to your yard sale.

87
00:04:37,720 --> 00:04:39,400
他人真好
Aw, that's so nice of him.

88
00:04:39,500 --> 00:04:41,040
他完全不知道这件事呢
Oh, yeah, he doesn't know about it.

89
00:04:41,600 --> 00:04:42,960
这是他那些
Yeah, it's all the stuff

90
00:04:42,960 --> 00:04:44,580
留在我家没拿走的东西
he's been leaving around my apartment.

91
00:04:45,000 --> 00:04:47,760
他越来越没自觉 不懂分寸 所以...
He's getting way too comfortable, so...

92
00:04:47,760 --> 00:04:48,960
统统卖了吧
Sell it all! Yeah.

93
00:04:51,620 --> 00:04:54,180
他那本护照你估计可以卖个几块钱吧
You probably can get a couple of bucks for his passport.

94
00:04:54,180 --> 00:04:56,160
他花八十块买的
Yeah, he paid $80 for it.

95
00:04:57,300 --> 00:04:58,860
他把东西留下
Maybe he's leaving things around

96
00:04:58,860 --> 00:05:00,840
很可能是因为想跟你再进一步啊
because he wants to take things to another level,

97
00:05:01,120 --> 00:05:02,320
可能想搬来同居呢
maybe even move in.

98
00:05:03,420 --> 00:05:04,980
闺蜜私语啊
Oh, girl talk.

99
00:05:06,780 --> 00:05:09,520
你们不像电视上那样 先给我倒杯鸡尾酒吗
Shouldn't you serve me a cosmo like they do on television?

100
00:05:11,120 --> 00:05:13,500
我们俩穷光蛋 家里没鸡尾酒
Don't have any cosmos, as we're broke

101
00:05:13,500 --> 00:05:14,920
而且现在也不是1998年《欲望都市》热播的时候
and it's not 1998, but...

102
00:05:16,540 --> 00:05:18,820
-要不来个粉红小蛋糕吧 -这个更好
- how about a pink cupcake? - Oh, even better.

103
00:05:20,060 --> 00:05:22,200
奥列格都跟你表白过 说爱你了
Maybe now that Oleg has told you he loves you,

104
00:05:22,200 --> 00:05:24,700
会不会是你对亲密关系有恐惧症呢
you're starting to have intimacy issues about getting close.

105
00:05:25,560 --> 00:05:27,120
拜托哦
Oh, come on.

106
00:05:27,580 --> 00:05:29,700
这种废话你留着废物拍卖会卖吧
Save that garbage for your yard sale.

107
00:05:30,500 --> 00:05:33,360
那家伙就是太常在楼上了
Yeah, the man is just up there too much.

108
00:05:33,820 --> 00:05:37,380
虽然他在楼上时都在我"下面" 但...
I mean, he's down there when he's up there, but, yeah...

109
00:05:37,380 --> 00:05:40,440
但他真的太常来了
It's way too much, yeah.

110
00:05:40,440 --> 00:05:42,380
他得改改 不然就得滚
He's got to change, or he's out.

111
00:05:42,900 --> 00:05:45,000
麦克斯 谢谢你的小蛋糕
Hey, thanks for the cupcake, Max.

112
00:05:45,400 --> 00:05:46,420
卡洛琳
And, Caroline...

113
00:05:47,200 --> 00:05:49,200
我不知道你有啥贡献 随便啦
I don't know what you add, but, yeah.

114
00:05:52,460 --> 00:05:54,607
我们的旧货拍卖还没布置好
Our yard sale is not quite all set up yet.

115
00:05:54,607 --> 00:05:56,700
你来早了 传单说下午一点到五点
You're Early. Our flyer said 1:00 to 5:00.

116
00:05:56,700 --> 00:05:58,380
我讨厌传单
Oh, I don't do flyers.

117
00:05:59,340 --> 00:06:00,880
特鲁迪小姐 我的名片
Miss Trudy, my card.

118
00:06:01,340 --> 00:06:03,040
她是我老婆 特鲁迪小姐
This is my wife, Miss Trudy,

119
00:06:03,040 --> 00:06:04,640
而这鸟的名字叫斯考特
and the bird's name is Scott.

120
00:06:05,524 --> 00:06:07,174
丹尼斯·恩迪克特三世
Dennis Endicott the third,

121
00:06:07,174 --> 00:06:10,484
旧货店寻宝员与布鲁克林疯狂媚俗艺术天才
Thrift shop scout and Brooklyn's crazy kitsch genius.

122
00:06:12,240 --> 00:06:13,300
"万物之王"[改编自《魔戒》]
"Lord of the things."

123
00:06:16,680 --> 00:06:19,560
我们有很多古典文化物品
So, I have lots of classic couture pieces.

124
00:06:19,560 --> 00:06:20,720
您绝对不会失望
You won't be disappointed.

125
00:06:20,960 --> 00:06:24,420
我们失望过了 特鲁迪小姐 你说说
Well, I have been before. Miss Trudy?

126
00:06:24,740 --> 00:06:27,231
我们大老远跑去宾州
We went all the way to Pennsylvania for

127
00:06:27,231 --> 00:06:29,009
参加电视剧《生命的事实》投沙包游戏
a Facts of Life bean bag toss game.

128
00:06:29,009 --> 00:06:30,980
布莱儿居然不在啊 布莱儿
No Blair! No Blair.

129
00:06:30,980 --> 00:06:32,460
就去了两个托蒂家的小角色
Just two Tooties.

130
00:06:34,440 --> 00:06:36,860
老天有时就他妈爱捉弄人
Life just sucks it hard sometimes.

131
00:06:36,860 --> 00:06:37,604
对吧 斯考特
Am I right, Scott?

132
00:06:37,604 --> 00:06:40,160
那边椅子上都是我的东西
So, on that chair are my things,

133
00:06:40,160 --> 00:06:41,480
你会发现里面有很多...
and you'll notice that there's a lot

134
00:06:41,540 --> 00:06:43,900
我发现了 14 全收了
Oh, I already did. 14 for all of it.

135
00:06:44,040 --> 00:06:45,525
1400块吗 没问题
$1,400, perfect!

136
00:06:45,525 --> 00:06:48,961
什么1400块 宝贝 是14快
Hundred? Darling, $14.

137
00:06:49,780 --> 00:06:51,420
这些都是复古玩意呢
But this is all vintage.

138
00:06:51,980 --> 00:06:53,940
是复古 还是过季而已啊
Vintage, or just out of season?

139
00:06:55,180 --> 00:06:56,960
等等 那是鸡块宝宝吗
Wait, is that a nugget buddy?

140
00:06:57,420 --> 00:06:58,760
特鲁迪小姐 他们有鸡块宝宝牛仔版
Miss Trudy, they have the cowboy.

141
00:06:59,220 --> 00:07:00,180
他爱死那个了
He loves the cowboy.

142
00:07:00,600 --> 00:07:01,720
必须的
I bet he does.

143
00:07:03,560 --> 00:07:05,200
我松了好大一口气
Oh, I am so relieved.

144
00:07:05,260 --> 00:07:07,538
每次我们没淘到什么好宝贝 他会很生气
When we don't find anything good, he gets really mad...

145
00:07:07,538 --> 00:07:09,420
我就遭殃了
at me.

146
00:07:10,040 --> 00:07:12,000
抱歉 那个是不小心放出来的
I'm sorry, that's not supposed to be out.

147
00:07:12,000 --> 00:07:13,000
我不想拆了那组玩具
I can't break up the set.

148
00:07:13,500 --> 00:07:15,300
你十个鸡块宝宝全有吗
You have all ten nugget buddies?

149
00:07:15,460 --> 00:07:18,400
以及1993年至今每个开心乐园餐玩具
Yep, and every other happy meal toy since 1993.

150
00:07:18,400 --> 00:07:20,360
我妈以前整天带我去麦当劳
My mom used to take me there a lot.

151
00:07:20,580 --> 00:07:22,740
也常常就把我丢在麦当劳 都一样啦
Well, she used to leave me there a lot, but same diff.

152
00:07:24,840 --> 00:07:26,260
-六百块买你那一组 -成交
- $600 for the whole collection. - Sold!

153
00:07:26,720 --> 00:07:27,860
不不 才不卖呢
Whoa, whoa, not sold.

154
00:07:27,960 --> 00:07:29,580
卖了吧 这关系到我们未来呢
Max, come on, this is our future.

155
00:07:29,760 --> 00:07:31,560
那还是我的过去呢 不卖
Well, those are my past. No sale.

156
00:07:32,200 --> 00:07:33,120
咱们走 斯考特
Let's go, Scott.

157
00:07:33,220 --> 00:07:35,200
"托蒂门"事件又重演了
This is "Tootiegate" all over again.

158
00:07:36,380 --> 00:07:37,200
还有你
And you

159
00:07:37,280 --> 00:07:39,840
我们回家后 你最好快点戴上打屁屁枕头
when we get home, you better put on the punishment pillow.

160
00:07:43,200 --> 00:07:45,800
别担心 我就好这口
Don't worry. I kind of like it.

161
00:07:48,680 --> 00:07:50,580
这下子戴帽子的马
Well, so much for a horse in a hat

162
00:07:50,580 --> 00:07:52,320
都不再是这里最怪的一件事了
being the weirdest thing in this yard.

163
00:07:59,340 --> 00:08:00,440
再跟我解释一次
Explain to me again

164
00:08:00,440 --> 00:08:04,400
一个我两年前花三千块买的东西
how an item I paid $3,000 for just two years ago

165
00:08:04,400 --> 00:08:05,720
现在比一个
is worth less than something

166
00:08:05,720 --> 00:08:07,260
有沾酱的东西还便宜
that came with a dipping sauce!

