336
00:16:54,800 --> 00:16:57,420
抱歉你觉得自己什么都会做
Sorry that you think you know how to do everything.

337
00:16:57,620 --> 00:17:00,180
抱歉你不愿承认我会做生意的这一事实
Sorry that you resent the fact that I know how to do business.

338
00:17:00,440 --> 00:17:03,020
抱歉你觉得自己很会做生意
Sorry that you think you know how to do business,

339
00:17:03,080 --> 00:17:04,960
或者这就是我们第一家店倒闭的原因
and maybe that's why our first business failed.

340
00:17:06,380 --> 00:17:09,860
抱歉你每天的休息两次去抽大麻
Sorry that you took two weed breaks every single day

341
00:17:09,860 --> 00:17:11,220
而不是打电话招揽生意
instead of making work calls,

342
00:17:11,220 --> 00:17:13,400
或者这才是我们蛋糕店倒闭的原因
And maybe that's why our business failed.

343
00:17:13,860 --> 00:17:16,580
抱歉我没有多休息多抽大麻
Sorry that I didn't take more weed breaks,

344
00:17:16,580 --> 00:17:19,120
因为我觉得跟你这种自称无所不知的人工作
because I really could have used them working with

345
00:17:19,120 --> 00:17:19,720
真的很需要麻痹自己
a know-it-all like you!

346
00:17:19,720 --> 00:17:20,480
抱歉该轮到我指责你了
And sorry it's my turn!

347
00:17:20,480 --> 00:17:24,491
不 抱歉你对奥列格和苏菲的私事
No! Sorry that you, also, had to stick your nose

348
00:17:24,491 --> 00:17:25,680
多管闲事
into Oleg and Sophie's business,

349
00:17:25,680 --> 00:17:27,640
搞得现在男的劈腿 女的抓狂
So that he cheated, and she got mad and then,

350
00:17:27,640 --> 00:17:30,160
经过一连串不可否认的直接作用
by an almost irrefutable line of direct action,

351
00:17:30,360 --> 00:17:31,700
你害死了我的玩具
you killed my toys!

352
00:17:32,120 --> 00:17:35,360
抱歉无论之前我是否做对过多少事情
Sorry that it doesn't matter how many things I ever did right

353
00:17:35,360 --> 00:17:37,114
只要麦克斯开心乐园儿童餐的
because poor itty-bitty baby

354
00:17:37,114 --> 00:17:40,277
可怜小玩具全碎了 我就是错的
Max's happy meal toys got all broked!

355
00:17:41,360 --> 00:17:43,280
别逼我 麦克斯
Don't push me, Max!

356
00:17:46,240 --> 00:17:48,320
你不是打造品牌的粉丝吗
You're such a fan of branding,

357
00:17:48,900 --> 00:17:50,620
"做就对了"[耐克广告语]
"Just do it."

358
00:17:50,820 --> 00:17:52,240
"按你想做的去做"[汉堡王广告语]
"Have it your way."

359
00:17:52,240 --> 00:17:55,340
"拉斯维加斯输的钱 就留在拉斯维加斯吧"
"What happens in vegas, stays in vegas."

360
00:17:56,120 --> 00:17:56,860
"有喝牛奶了吗"
"Got milk?"

361
00:17:57,740 --> 00:18:00,080
有想到其他白痴的生意标语吗
Got any other stupid business ideas?

362
00:18:02,940 --> 00:18:03,580
住手
Stop!

363
00:18:04,760 --> 00:18:05,432
住手 住手 快住手
Stop, stop, stop it, stop it!

364
00:18:05,432 --> 00:18:09,020
我受够了
I am done!

365
00:18:09,020 --> 00:18:10,920
不 我才受够了
No, I'm done!

366
00:18:11,020 --> 00:18:12,500
不 我们都受够了
No, we're both done!

367
00:18:12,580 --> 00:18:14,300
好 咱们俩都受够了
Fine, we're both done!

368
00:18:14,380 --> 00:18:15,720
-受够了 -我也是
- Done! - Done!

369
00:18:15,880 --> 00:18:17,720
不 我是真的受够了 麦克斯
No, I'm really done, Max!

370
00:18:17,860 --> 00:18:19,660
我厌倦了努力让梦想成真
I'm tired of trying to make things happen!

371
00:18:19,700 --> 00:18:22,060
我厌倦了逼着我们开蛋糕店
I'm tired of pushing us into cupcake shops!

372
00:18:22,240 --> 00:18:25,160
我也厌倦了你逼着我们开蛋糕店
And I'm tired of you pushing us into cupcake shops too.

373
00:18:25,640 --> 00:18:27,960
我们本来就没能力花钱开店
Shops that we couldn't afford in the first place.

374
00:18:31,880 --> 00:18:33,600
天啊 天啊 麦克斯
Oh, my God! Oh, my God, Max!

375
00:18:33,780 --> 00:18:34,820
麦克斯 你没事吧
Max, are you all right?

376
00:18:35,820 --> 00:18:36,500
心肺复苏 是怎么做的来着
CPR, what is it?

377
00:18:36,560 --> 00:18:38,200
捏住她鼻子 然后往她嘴里吹气吗
Do you do pinch the nose and breathe into the mouth?

378
00:18:38,240 --> 00:18:38,940
慢着慢着
Wait, wait!

379
00:18:38,940 --> 00:18:40,666
我觉得应该先按压胸部
I think you're supposed to pump the chest first.

380
00:18:40,666 --> 00:18:45,640
我永远都不可能翻越这两座"大山"
Well, I'll never get through those!

381
00:18:45,640 --> 00:18:47,820
麦克斯 我要跟你嘴对嘴了
Max, I'm about to put my mouth on yours,

382
00:18:47,820 --> 00:18:50,300
所以如果你不是闹着玩 那你最好现在醒来
so if you're kidding you better wake up right now.

383
00:18:56,000 --> 00:18:57,240
麦克斯 求你别死
Max, please don't die.

384
00:18:57,300 --> 00:18:59,020
求你别死 你是我最好的朋友
Please don't die. You're my best friend.

385
00:19:02,920 --> 00:19:04,360
坐起来 坐起来
Sit up! Sit up, sit up!

386
00:19:04,680 --> 00:19:06,840
-你没事吧 -发生什么事了
- Are you all right? - What happened?

387
00:19:07,200 --> 00:19:08,280
你刚抓到电线
You grabbed that wire,

388
00:19:08,280 --> 00:19:09,900
应该是触电了
and I think you got a little electrocuted.

389
00:19:11,040 --> 00:19:12,460
我一直觉得我会被电
I always knew I'd be electrocuted,

390
00:19:12,540 --> 00:19:13,920
但我以为会是在电椅[死刑]上
I just thought it would be in the chair.

391
00:19:15,850 --> 00:19:17,060
天啊 我热死了 我需要新鲜空气
God, I'm so hot. I need air.

392
00:19:17,060 --> 00:19:18,400
来这里 这边有窗 来
Come here. The window, come on.

393
00:19:19,440 --> 00:19:21,060
来 来 到这里
Come on. Come on, over here.

394
00:19:21,060 --> 00:19:23,600
这里 跪着 打开了
Here, kneel. Open!

395
00:19:24,040 --> 00:19:25,180
靠 还有护窗板
Oh, damn, there are shutters.

396
00:19:25,360 --> 00:19:27,000
我来弄开 你抓住墙
Here, hold on to the wall while I get this.

397
00:19:30,200 --> 00:19:33,100
你没事吧 深呼一口气
Are you okay? Take a deep breath in.

398
00:19:33,400 --> 00:19:34,280
吸气
Breathe in.

399
00:19:35,060 --> 00:19:36,200
麦克斯 刚才太吓人了
Max, that was so scary.

400
00:19:36,260 --> 00:19:37,680
有那么一瞬间 我以为你死了
For a second, I thought you died.

401
00:19:38,120 --> 00:19:40,860
真可能呢 我记得看到一个满是火焰的地方
Maybe I did, 'cause I kind of remember a place with flames.

402
00:19:41,380 --> 00:19:42,940
然后你在跟我亲热
and you were making out with me.

403
00:19:44,620 --> 00:19:46,680
什么味道这么香
What is that delicious smell?

404
00:19:47,680 --> 00:19:49,680
隔壁酒吧旁的披萨店
The pizza place next to the bar next door.

405
00:19:49,680 --> 00:19:52,220
天啊 披萨的味道有这么好闻过吗
Oh, God, has a pizza ever smelled so good?

406
00:19:54,720 --> 00:19:55,560
你们俩在干嘛
Hey, what are you guys doing?

407
00:19:55,740 --> 00:19:57,140
这里是商店还是什么吗
Is that, like, a store or something?

408
00:19:57,780 --> 00:19:59,920
-不是 -真可惜
- No. - Holler.

409
00:20:02,140 --> 00:20:03,260
慢着 卡洛琳
Wait, Caroline...

410
00:20:04,340 --> 00:20:06,800
这就是我们的"机遇之窗"
This is our window of opportunity!

411
00:20:07,360 --> 00:20:08,780
麦克斯 这个主意太棒了
Max, what a great idea!

412
00:20:08,820 --> 00:20:11,560
蛋糕外卖窗口 你就是个天才
A cupcake walk-up window? You're a genius!

413
00:20:11,880 --> 00:20:14,020
我死而复生之后 可能变聪明了
I just might be since I died!

414
00:20:14,940 --> 00:20:16,580
费用少太多了
So much less overhead.

415
00:20:16,580 --> 00:20:18,360
这次我们从底层做起
And this time we'll be starting at the bottom,

416
00:20:18,380 --> 00:20:19,840
我们不能往下走 只能往上爬
so we'll have nowhere to go but up.

417
00:20:20,360 --> 00:20:21,060
谢天谢地
Thank God!

418
00:20:21,060 --> 00:20:23,080
在底层的感觉真是舒服太多了
I am so much more comfortable at the bottom!

419
00:20:24,580 --> 00:20:27,355
我心里有一种异样的感觉
Hey, I have this weird feeling inside.

420
00:20:27,355 --> 00:20:31,149
我就是开心乐园餐
I'm Mchappy.

421
00:20:32,320 --> 00:20:33,480
姑娘们
Hey, girls.

422
00:20:33,940 --> 00:20:36,420
像阿姆斯特丹的妓女那样 在橱窗里服务吗
Turning tricks in a window like they do in Amsterdam?

423
00:20:38,140 --> 00:20:40,440
不 我们刚发现了新的生意机会
No, we think we found our new business.

424
00:20:40,540 --> 00:20:43,020
苏菲 这里是新的麦克斯自制小蛋糕店
Sophie, this is the new Max's homemade cupcakes.

425
00:20:43,600 --> 00:20:47,240
说到窗户 那是奥列格的车吧
Speaking of windows, that's Oleg's car, right?

426
00:20:49,640 --> 00:20:51,480
太好了
Yeah. Yeah.

427
00:20:57,340 --> 00:20:59,540
有人打开机遇之窗
Well, some people open windows,

428
00:20:59,740 --> 00:21:00,960
有人砸烂车窗
some people smash them.
